# Regenerable, large, or run-local.
#
# The signal caches (data/*.npz) are the only GPU-expensive artefacts here — ~10-15 GPU-min for
# both variants — but they are keyed on the training file's content and rebuild deterministically,
# so they travel with the run to S3 rather than into git. Everything the pool and the reference
# adapter need is already in impl5_ssd/.gitignore's territory.
data/shards/
data/*.npz
data/*.log
runs/
artifacts/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
